\end_layout

\end_inset

 in BiocPy against R’s 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
GenomicRanges
\end_layout

\end_inset

 (v1.64.0) across 
\begin_inset Formula $10^{5}$
\end_inset

