 which we recommend as a general development paradigm for bioinformatics method developers seeking to make their tools accessible across multiple languages.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Under this paradigm,
 core algorithms are implemented once in C++ libraries.
 Matrix access is abstracted through the C++ 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status open

