\begin_layout Section
Case Studies
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Combining native Bioconductor-compatible containers with shared C++ backends and language-neutral persistence enables end-to-end genomic workflows in Python as well as hybrid pipelines spanning R and Python.
 Below,
 we present three workflows illustrating range-based genomic overlap queries,
 cross-language access to curated data repositories,
 and multi-modal single-cell analysis.
